@startuml Phase1b_Channel_Opening

!theme plain
autonumber

hide footbox

actor "Cliente" as Client
participant "Vendedor" as Vendor
participant "API do Emissor" as Issuer
database "BD do Emissor\n(Redis)" as IssuerDB

Client -> Vendor: Obter chave pública do vendedor
Vendor --> Client: Chave pública do vendedor
Client -> Client: Preparar requisição de abertura de canal

Client -> Issuer: Requisição de abertura de canal
activate Issuer

Issuer -> Issuer: Verificar requisição
Issuer -> IssuerDB: Bloquear fundos e criar canal
IssuerDB --> Issuer: OK

Issuer --> Client: Canal aberto
deactivate Issuer

@enduml
